r and outdoor dining areas. Try our famous Stuffed Avocados or Shaken Ceviche, or stop by for our happy hour and try a Mexican Martini. Spice up your Taco Tuesday with a Cheesteak Taco and Tex-Mex Margarita while you enjoy live music from our patio — and bring your dog with you, too! Trudy’s North Star is family- and pet-friendly, with something for everyone to enjoy. Have a taste of authentic Tex-Mex cuisine when you visit us today!"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-ltOVf5XQ20w/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AzG7KkaLXhw/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[0],"Austin, TX",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["(512) 454-1474",[["(512) 454-1474",1],["+1 512-454-1474",2]],null,"+15124541474",null,["tel:+15124541474",null,null,"2ahUKEwiF9PehhoOYAxV8l2oFHblOIOMQ_doBKAx6BAgFEA8"]]],null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,"7260617764162898000","101885997836426216291"],null,[[[7,[["Trudy's North Star"],["8820 Burnet Rd"],["Austin, TX 78757"]]],[2,[["Trudy's North Star, 8820 Burnet Rd, Austin, TX 78757"]]],[1,[["8820 Burnet Rd, Austin, TX 78757"]]],[4,[["Austin, TX"]]]],["North Shoal Creek","8820 Burnet Rd","8820 Burnet Rd","Austin","78757","Texas","US"],["2ahUKEwiF9PehhoOYAxV8l2oFHblOIOMQqtMBKAh6BAgFEAs",["862497CC+7X"],["97CC+7X Austin, Texas"],3]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,[[null,null,30.3706878,-97.7275767]],"ChlUcnVkeSdzIE5vcnRoIFN0YXIgQXVzdGlukgESdGV4X21leF9yZXN0YXVyYW504AEA",null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["0x8644cb9692a6d6e3:0xef2fe0ba40a18f",null,null,"/m/020zgmc","ChIJ49amkpbLRIYRj6FAuuAv7wA","7260617764162898000","101885997836426216291"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[1,["Our policies do not